.KEY HOST,PORT/N
.BRA {
.KET }
; ClaudeCode: Claude Code on the NAS (your Claude subscription), in this
; window. The NAS asks for the uptelnet password (set on the NAS with
; setpw; it is never stored here), then Claude Code starts in tmux --
; quit it or lose the line and the session is still there next time.
;   ClaudeCode [HOST] [PORT]        default 192.168.0.198 2323
; From Workbench: double-click its icon (IconX opens an UP-Term window).
uptelnet {HOST$192.168.0.198} {PORT$2323}
